        <item>
            <title>0.25.5</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 08:56:51 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>52</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.25.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.45 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1f;margin:0;padding:2px 4px}h3{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 6px}ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}li{margin:0 0 4px}code{font:12px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){body{color:#f5f5f7}}</style><h3>What's new in Keeploop 0.25.5</h3><ul><li>Keeploop's plugins for Claude Code and for ChatGPT and Codex now update themselves when Keeploop starts. You can turn this off in Settings &gt; Connect.</li><li>A Keeploop plugin installed from a plugin store is recognized and kept up to date by that store; Keeploop no longer offers to install a second copy.</li><li>Open AI sessions keep working after Keeploop updates, starting with this version. You no longer need to reconnect.</li><li>Answering Wake anyway or Allow from your phone is more reliable when you also answer on the Mac.</li></ul>]]></description>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
